{#
General Agent System Prompt - English Version
==============================================
Master template that orchestrates all general agent modules.

This template follows the modular architecture pattern:
- base.jinja2: Identity and core capabilities
- modules/business_info.jinja2: Company info, hours, contact
- modules/policies.jinja2: Payment, shipping, returns, warranty
- modules/response_style.jinja2: Tone and examples (A/B testable)

A/B TEST EXPERIMENT SUPPORT
----------------------------
The response_style module supports A/B testing with parameter:
  response_detail_level (str): "detailed" or "concise"

Version History:
  v1.0 (2025-10-11): Initial modular version
    - response_detail_level = "detailed" (Variant A - Detailed responses)

  v1.1 (2025-10-11): Concise response style
    - response_detail_level = "concise" (Variant B - Concise responses)

Variables:
  - version (str): Template version identifier (v1.0, v1.1, etc.)
  - business (dict): Company information from business_info.yaml
  - policies (dict): Policies from policies.yaml
  - response_detail_level (str): A/B test parameter for response style

Author: Lab01-MCP Team
Created: 2025-10-11
Version: {{ version|default('v1.0') }}
